PWA / APK export ke baare me batao
Aap apni Class10to12ExmLeaker HTML app ko PWA (Progressive Web App) aur Android APK dono me bohot aasani se convert karke apne students ko de sakte hain. Yahan dono ke aasan aur step-by-step tareeqe diye gaye hain:

Tareeqa 1: Instant PWA banana (Sabse Aasan & Free)
PWA ka faayda yeh hai ki bina Play Store ke, students aapki link par click karke direct apne phone me app icon install kar sakte hain.

manifest.json file add karein: Apni HTML file ke saath ek manifest.json file banayein:
{
  "name": "Class10to12ExmLeaker",
  "short_name": "ExmLeaker",
  "start_url": "index.html",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#0b1229",
  "theme_color": "#06b6d4",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "icon-512.png",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/png"
    }
  ]
}
HTML <head> me link karein:
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#06b6d4">
Host karein: Is poori HTML file ko Netlify, Vercel, ya GitHub Pages par free me upload kar dein (sirf drag and drop).
Students ke liye: Jab student Chrome browser me link kholega, toh screen par "Add to Home Screen" ya "Install App" ka pop-up aayega. Install hone ke baad yeh bilkul ek asli Android app ki tarah offline chalegi.
Tareeqa 2: 1-Click APK Generator (Bina Coding ke APK)
Agar aapko apne students ko direct .apk file WhatsApp ya Telegram par share karni hai:

Website2APK Builder (Windows Software):

Free tool download karein: Web2Apk
"Local HTML Website" select karein aur apni HTML file daalein.
App Name: Class10to12ExmLeaker likhein, app logo upload karein.
"Generate APK" par click karein — 2 minute me direct .apk file taiyar ho jayegi.
PWABuilder (Microsoft ka Official Tool):

Apni app ko Vercel/Netlify par host karne ke baad pwabuilder.com par link paste karein.
Yeh automatically test karega aur "Package for Android" button dega jisse signed APK / AAB file download ho jayegi.
Tareeqa 3: Capacitor / Cordova (Professional Developer Method)
Agar aapko Play Store par upload karna ho:

Apne folder me run karein:
npm init -y
npm install @capacitor/core @capacitor/cli @capacitor/android
npx cap init Class10to12ExmLeaker com.musaitir.exmleaker
npx cap add android
npx cap open android
Android Studio open hoga, wahan Build > Build Bundle(s) / APK(s) > Build APK par click karein.
💡 Recommendation: Sabse tez aur best tareeqa hai ki aap apni HTML file ko GitHub Pages ya Netlify par free host karke PWA bana dein ya fir Web2Apk software se 2 minute me direct .apk file nikaal kar students ko distribute kar dein!

